{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useQueries<T, TCombinedResult>(options: ShallowOption & object, queryClient?: QueryClient): Readonly<Ref<TCombinedResult>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/useQueries.ts#L354","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/vue-query/src/useQueries.ts:354"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQueries"},{"type":"text","value":" composable can be used to fetch a variable number of queries."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queries"},{"type":"text","value":" option accepts an array of query option objects mostly identical to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":"'s. It may be a\nplain array, a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ref"},{"type":"text","value":"/reactive array (each entry tracked individually), or a getter function — pass a getter\nif the array itself (its length, or which queries are in it) depends on other reactive state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Having the same query key more than once in the array of query objects may cause some data to be shared\nbetween queries. To avoid this, consider de-duplicating the queries and map the results back to the desired\nstructure."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"combine"},{"type":"text","value":" option can be used to combine the results of the queries into a single value. The result will\nbe structurally shared to be as referentially stable as possible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"placeholderData"},{"type":"text","value":" is supported here too, but unlike "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":", it doesn't receive information from\npreviously rendered queries, because the number of queries can differ between renders."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tcombinedresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TCombinedResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TCombinedResult"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" [] ? [] : "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" ["},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Head"},{"type":"text","value":"] ? ["},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"GetUseQueryResult"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Head"},{"type":"text","value":">] : "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" ["},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Head"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"...Tails[]"},{"type":"text","value":"] ? ["},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"...Tails[]"},{"type":"text","value":"] "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" [] ? [] : ["},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"...Tails[]"},{"type":"text","value":"] "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" ["},{"type":"inlineCode","v